{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 130,
    "dDurationMs": 5150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have all heard of mind over matter, but\nis it possible that the right motivation can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5280,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually help repair spinal damage?I have\ncome to Lausanne, Switzerland to find out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10760,
    "dDurationMs": 5529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about some innovative research being done\nto repair the spinal cords of rats using pharmaceuticals,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16289,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "electrical signals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17289,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the key ingredient?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19579,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Motivation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21489,
    "dDurationMs": 6770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes with the right motivation anything\nis possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28259,
    "dDurationMs": 8311,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tres bien."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36570,
    "dDurationMs": 4550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The main function of the spinal cord is to\ntransmit neural signals or messages between"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41120,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the brain and the rest of the body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43460,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when the spinal cord is severed or crushed,\nthese messages can’t get past the injury."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48260,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The result is often chronic paralysis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52370,
    "dDurationMs": 4850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Research in this area generally focuses on\nregenerating damaged nerve fibers, but here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57220,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Lausanne they are taking a different approach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59430,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Bonjour, Derek."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60430,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Bonjour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61430,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Welcome in the lab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62430,
    "dDurationMs": 1010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Ah, thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63440,
    "dDurationMs": 3799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Professor Courtine’s work with rats is\nproducing remarkable results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67239,
    "dDurationMs": 6310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So I thought, what can we actually deliver\nto the spinal cord the kind of information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73549,
    "dDurationMs": 4651,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the brain would deliver naturally in\norder to walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78200,
    "dDurationMs": 3199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The rats have their spinal cord’s cut\nin two places."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81399,
    "dDurationMs": 6361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Although not completely severed, signals can’t\nget past the legion, leaving the rats paralyzed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87760,
    "dDurationMs": 4630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To reactivate the healthy, but disconnected\nneural cells below the injury, the researchers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92390,
    "dDurationMs": 4919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "administer a cocktail of synthetic neural\ntransmitters followed by electrical stimulation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97309,
    "dDurationMs": 7470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I am cutting the cable that connects to\nthe electrodes on the spinal cord so we can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104779,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "provide the stimulation to the spinal cord."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107219,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Ok."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108219,
    "dDurationMs": 2281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there are cables that run down the spinal\ncord?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110500,
    "dDurationMs": 5539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It actually runs under the skin and then\nit is sutured on top of the spinal cord."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116039,
    "dDurationMs": 5131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e This electro-chemical combination mimics\nthe input of the brain and reawakens the spinal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121170,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cord below the lesion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122280,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Now I start the 20 immediately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125170,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, as soon as that is working."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127920,
    "dDurationMs": 1569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is amazing, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129489,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The result?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130489,
    "dDurationMs": 5101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After a few weeks of training and while on\nthe treadmill, the rat is incredibly able"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135590,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to walk again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136590,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So this animal was completely paralyzed\nfive minutes ago and now she is doing {?} stepping"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140950,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the treadmill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142310,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now we have got 20 speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143970,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even got the... the animal is capable of {?} on\nthe treadmill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147790,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And look at this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149530,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can let him do it yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150570,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would stop the treadmill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151990,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, she stands immediately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154730,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e But this is happening without the involvement\nof the brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157950,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At this stage the rat’s stepping is stimulated\nby the treadmill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162440,
    "dDurationMs": 5210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The legs are moving independently of the brain,\nso the movement is completely involuntary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167650,
    "dDurationMs": 4750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You can train rats on this treadmill for\ntwo months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172400,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You will not see recovery of voluntary control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175100,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176100,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The brain is not involved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177100,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is no motivation to work, because we\nsee that the rat..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179120,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Motivation is the key to restoring voluntary\nmovement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182950,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is when the irresistible Swiss chocolate\ncomes in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186250,
    "dDurationMs": 7780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I brought a chocolate éclair . I ate half,\nbut the other half is for the rat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194030,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yes, eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195730,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e she does like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196730,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e She likes it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198200,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e We have a combination of like actually\nyogurt and chocolate which the rat love."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204400,
    "dDurationMs": 4949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e This reward based training without a treadmill\nwas the focus of the next phase of research."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209349,
    "dDurationMs": 1711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I have to get her in the right position."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211060,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e They designed a special robot which only\nsupports the paralyzed rat, but doesn’t"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215120,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "propel it forward."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216120,
    "dDurationMs": 6410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e This means that the rats really need to\ngenerate the propulsive forces to go to the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222530,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reward, which is the chocolate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225510,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So the rat is asked to go and to push herself\nforward."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230100,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But she does get a little bit of help up and\ndown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232740,
    "dDurationMs": 4550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So the rats have, again, been given electric\nchemical stimulants, but without the treadmill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237290,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rat has to decide for itself if it wants\nto walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241040,
    "dDurationMs": 6130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e When you want the animal to participate\nvery actively, I mean, we are talking about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247170,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the championships of rehabilitation, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251430,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need to motivate the rat at any cost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253540,
    "dDurationMs": 2509,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Come, come, come, come, come."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256049,
    "dDurationMs": 3131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So Rubia does whatever it takes to coax\nthe rat to walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259180,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Come on, jump, go forwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Push, then push."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Push it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Push and come on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Go, go, go, go, go, go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Come on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Keep going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267460,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The rat is now walking when it wants to,\nwhich means the brain’s signals are getting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270160,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through to the previously paralyzed limbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272740,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Wow, she has done really well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275100,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276220,
    "dDurationMs": 5570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e The rat’s spinal cord seems much more\ncapable of rewiring itself than anyone expected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281790,
    "dDurationMs": 4910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In one of the most extensive examples observed,\nit has been able to detour around the injury"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286700,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and reconnect the dormant neural network."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289600,
    "dDurationMs": 8730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e What we observe is that the cut fibers,\nbasically, they grow and deliver to this {?} injury"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298330,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enough information."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299790,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We don’t know what kind, but sufficient\ninformation from the brain to have voluntary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306270,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307610,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e What we are hearing is evidence of the\nrat making the decision to walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311790,
    "dDurationMs": 1599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The popping sound is a neuron firing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313389,
    "dDurationMs": 4211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here she is just standing, but you will\nsee once she starts walking there is a pretty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317600,
    "dDurationMs": 6310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "clear pattern of the activity of the neuron\nwith the rat stepping."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323910,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It is showing that the movement is voluntary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326210,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e That is really cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328370,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was really exciting the first time that\nhappened, because, you know, we had this idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332890,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the brain should be involved, but it\nhadn't been proven."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335610,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Go, go, go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336610,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e There is a whole team of people working\nand everybody is pushing the rat and everybody"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339840,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is all go, go, go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341530,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I could hear it before it happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342930,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I really knew, ok, it is going to work\nthis time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346430,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Perfect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347430,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348430,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With half of all human spinal injuries leading\nto chronic paralysis, Professor Courtine’s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353190,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "research gives new hope to those affected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355270,
    "dDurationMs": 7210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So, of course, the next obvious and, you\nknow, exciting goal is to try this type of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362480,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "intervention in humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363790,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don’t know, it is difficult to say what\nthis will achieve in humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368810,
    "dDurationMs": 24340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, you know, it is a very promising new\npath."
    } ]
  } ]
}
